      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Minecraft uses a virtual currency called \"Minecoins\" (or \"Minecraft Tokens\" on PlayStation), which costs real money. Kids use this to buy character outfits, special game modes, and downloadable worlds from the Minecraft Marketplace."
    },
