      "claim": "Child accounts collect data that can be shared with third parties and must be deleted manually.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "For children under 16, Microsoft automatically creates \"child accounts\" that must be linked to a parent account. This gives you access to powerful safety tools including chat filters, friend approval, and screen time limits, but these features need to be set up properly to be effective."
    },
